// v5.60 STATE / DESIGN
// Closed-candle signal -> primary trade + immediate opposite hedge.
// Multi-pair symbols have independent candle/volume/basket-trail state.
// Peak Volume is reused after a basket close; CandleCycleMultiplier=1.00 means NO DOUBLING.
// In candle mode, trailing is NET-BASKET based: individual hedge legs are never trailed/closed by ATR.
// Basket trail records peak NET floating profit and closes/reduces on configurable retracement.
// Close modes: whole basket / profitable positions only / selected side.
// Legacy per-position trailing remains available only when candle mode is disabled.
// EquityATR_CloseOnNewPeak defaults OFF; a new profit peak must never itself close trades.

